The following meristic characters were considered necessary for identi¬ 
fication of leafhoppers: 1. Median length of head; 2. Width of head,

interocular width and width across the eyes; 3. Median length of prono- 
turn; 4. Width of pronotum at its widest place; 5. Length of scutellum; 
6. Width of scutellum; 7. Total length from tip of head to the tip of 
folded tegmina.

